      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Application {{applicationId}}\n\n**Applicant:** {{applicant.name}} ({{applicant.type}})\n\nThe grid needs an upgrade before this system can connect.\n\n**Substation:** {{site.substationId}}\n\n**Projected load:** {{projectedLoadPct}} %",
